          "node_kind": "paragraph",
          "risk_level": "R1",
          "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
          "source_text": "Altogether we see that <MATH_0001> becomes a\n<MATH_0002>-set (see\nFundamental Groups, Definition <REF_0001>).\nHence we may think of the stalk functor as a functor\n<MATH_0003>\nand from now on we usually do think about the stalk functor in this way.",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
          "placeholders": {
