          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a field. Let <MATH_0002> be a separable closure of <MATH_0003>.\nConsider the profinite group <MATH_0004>.\nThe functor\n<MATH_0005>\nis an equivalence of categories.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
