          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a site whose topology is subcanonical.\nThe Yoneda embedding <MATH_0002> (see\nCategories, Section <REF_0001>)\npresents <MATH_0003> as a full subcategory of the\ncategory of sheaves of <MATH_0004>. In this case\nwe call sheaves of the form <MATH_0005> with <MATH_0006>\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>representable sheaves<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> on <MATH_0007>.\nNotation: Sometimes, the representable sheaf <MATH_0008> associated to <MATH_0009> is\ndenoted <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
